# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
# WSL-side scripts strip CR anyway (tr -d '\r'), Windows editors handle LF, and
# the pre-2026-09-04 tree was a 37 CRLF / 87 LF mix that cost debugging cycles.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
